@startuml
title MW-10 - Plan Upgrade and Payment

start
:Open the pricing page;

:Load the plans and the account information;
:Display the plans and the comparison table;

:Select a monthly or yearly cycle;
:Click "Buy this plan";

:Create the payment transaction;
:Redirect to the payment gateway;

:Make the payment;

:Receive the payment result;
:Reconcile the transaction status;

if (Status?) then (Success)
  :Activate the purchased plan;
  :Create the invoice;
  :Show the new plan and the invoice;
elseif (Pending) then (Pending)
  :Auto-reconcile again after a few seconds;
  :Wait for the system confirmation;
else (Failed)
  :Display the failure reason;
  :Retry or create a new transaction;
endif

stop
@enduml
